# Copy to .env.test and run `npm run supabase:start` first.
# These values come straight from that command's output (also visible via
# `npm run supabase:status`). The demo values below are Supabase's fixed
# local-dev defaults -- identical on every machine, not secrets.
# SUPABASE_URL is the bare API_URL field -- not REST_URL (API_URL + "/rest/v1"),
# which the status output prints right next to it.
